    "why": "The mark was confined to these blocks, so every address outside them kept whatever it held and this run says nothing about what the subject did to it. That is not the same as having found nothing there: a byte already at its power-on value reads identically whether the message restored it or never reached it, which is the whole reason the state is broken first."
